# ==========================================
# KEEP THESE (needed for production runtime):
# - dist/           (built application - DO NOT EXCLUDE)
# - server/         (Express server source - needed for runtime imports)
# - shared/         (shared types/schemas - needed for runtime)
# - package.json    (dependencies manifest)
# - package-lock.json (reproducible installs)
# - node_modules/   (Replit rebuilds this during deployment)
# ==========================================
